 minutes:</p></div></div><div class="x2yd3zd"><div class="xmlpigy"><div class="p2 xuszldq"><p class="xspwoe5">Facilities-Based, Not a Reseller</p></div><div class="xkcikp3"><div class="bullet-point x6idugm"><div class="icon xyojafn"><div class="material x8n8qcu"><svg fill="rgb(120, 120, 120)" width="100%" height="100%" aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9 16.17 4.83 12l-1.42 1.41L9 19 21 7l-1.41-1.41z"/></svg></div></div><p class="xv3l5jr">FCC 214 licensed international carrier since 1998</p></div><div class="bullet-point x6idugm"><div class="icon xyojafn"><div class="material x8n8qcu"><svg fill="rgb(120, 120, 120)" width="100%" height="100%" aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9 16.17 4.83 12l-1.42 1.41L9 19 21 7l-1.41-1.41z"/></svg></div></div><p class="xv3l5jr">Hundreds of direct carrier and NNI relationships</p></div><div class="bullet-point x6idugm"><div class="icon xyojafn"><div class="material x8n8qcu"><svg fill="rgb(120, 120, 120)" width="100%" height="100%" aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9 16.17 4.83 12l-1.42 1.41L9 19 21 7l-1.41-1.41z"/></svg></div></div><p class="xv3l5jr">24/7 NOC monitoring across every business line</p></div></div><a class="link-button xzjxv9b" href="/vocom-services"><p class="x9uyvup">See Our Network Coverage</p><div class="material x3b1erb"><svg fill="rgb(13, 13, 13)" width="100%" height="100%" aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M16.01 11H4v2h12.01v3L20 12l-3.99-4z"/></svg></div></a></div><div class="placeholder xiwykco"><img class="fill-img" src="/assets/img/placeholder-image-69690f.jpg" srcset="/assets/img/placeholder-image-69690f-512w.webp 512w, /assets/img/placeholder-image-69690f-1024w.webp 1024w, /assets/img/placeholder-image-69690f.jpg 1920w" 