ass="fill-img" src="/assets/img/vocom-international-15f76d.jpg" srcset="/assets/img/vocom-international-15f76d-512w.webp 512w, /assets/img/vocom-international-15f76d-1024w.webp 1024w, /assets/img/vocom-international-15f76d.jpg 1920w" sizes="(min-width: 810px) and (max-width: 1199.98px) 100vw, (max-width: 809.98px) 100vw, 100vw" width="1920" height="1280" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/><div class="p2 xlxn3qc"><div class="xo4ml8w"><p class="xx7nktr">TDM and VoIP/NGN</p><p class="x2ad7rc">Local, national and international interconnects through legacy TDM and modern VoIP/NGN.</p></div></div></a><a class="xv9tkel" href="/vocom-services"><img class="fill-img" src="/assets/img/vocom-international-dd153d.jpg" srcset="/assets/img/vocom-international-dd153d-512w.webp 512w, /assets/img/vocom-international-dd153d-1024w.webp 1024w, /assets/img/vocom-international-dd153d.jpg 1920w" sizes="(min-width: 810px) and (max-width: 1199.98px) 100vw, (max-width: 809.98px) 100vw, 100vw" width="1920" height="1282" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/><div class="p2 xlxn3qc"><div class="xo4ml8w"><p class="xx7nktr">MVNO and MNO</p><p class="x2ad7rc">US MVNO service on the T-Mobile network and MNO status in Canada.</p></div></div></a><a class="xv9tkel" href="/vocom-services"><img class="fill-img" src="/assets/img/vocom-international-74f851.jpg" srcset="/assets/img/vocom-international-74f851-512w.webp 512w, /assets/img/vocom-international-74f851-1024w.webp 1024w, /assets/img/vocom-international-74f851.jpg 1080w" sizes="(min-width: 810px) and (max-width: 1199.98px) 100vw, (max-width: 809.98px) 100vw, 100vw" width="1080" height="1080" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/><div class="p2 xlxn3qc"><div class="xo4ml8w"><p class="xx7nktr">IP Transit and DIA</p><p class="x2ad7rc">Local peering blended with global BGP across 20+ PoPs, including a dedicated China route by carrier.</p></div></div></a><a class="xv9tkel" href="/vocom-services"><img class="fill-img" src="/assets/img/vocom-international-b5a705.jpg" srcset="/assets/img/vocom-international-b5a705-512w.webp 512w, /assets/img/vocom-international-b5a705-1024w.webp 1024w, /assets/img/vocom-international-b5a705.jpg 1920w" sizes="(min-width: 810px) and (max-width: 1199.98px) 100vw, (max-width: 809.98px) 100vw, 100vw" width="1920" height="960" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/><div class="p2 xlxn3qc"><div class="xo4ml8w"><p class="xx7nktr">Private Circuits</p><p class="x2ad7rc">IEPL and IPLC private leased circuits across the Pacific for traffic that cannot share a path.</p></div></div></a></div><a class="xg6he0s" href="/vocom-services"><img class="fill-img" src="/assets/img/vocom-international-cc0050.jpg" srcset="/assets/img/vocom-international-cc0050-512w.webp 512w, /assets/img/vocom-international-cc0050-1024w.webp 1024w, /assets/img/vocom-international-cc0050.jpg 1920w" sizes="(min-width: 810px) and (max-width: 1199.98px) 100vw, (max-width: 809.98px) 100vw, 100vw" width="1920" height="1280" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/><div class="p2 xlxn3qc"><div class="xo4ml8w"><p class="xx7nktr">24/7 NOC Monitoring</p><p class="x2ad7rc">The same NOC watches voice routes, IP transit and MPLS around the clock.</p></div></div></a><a class="x8nee5a" href="/vocom-services"><img class="fill-img" src="/assets/img/vocom-international-3ff171.jpg" srcset="/assets/img/vocom-international-3ff171-512w.webp 512w, /assets/img/vocom-international-3ff171-1024w.webp 1024w, /assets/img/vocom-international-3ff171.jpg 1920w" sizes="(min-width: 810px) and (max-width: 1199.98px) 100vw, (max-width: 809.98px) 100vw, 100vw" width="1920" height="1280" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/><div class="p2 xlxn3qc"><div class="xo4ml8w"><p class="xx7nktr">Anti-DDoS Protection</p><p class="x2ad7rc">Regional scrubbing centers across Asia and the US/EU keep volumetric and application-layer attacks off the route.</p></div></div></a></div></div><div class="netmap-wrap"><NetworkMap /></div><div class="section-divider xbstc8l"><div class="x2h0iev"></div><div class="xqo6eaw"></div><div class="x2h0iev"></div></div><div class="4 xs4tdkn"><div class="xmrbb9j"><h3 class="h3 x10uerp">Vocom by the Numbers</h3><p class="xq9pbwc">One carrier-grade backbone, three business lines:</p></div><div class="xgbie5l"><div class="xkgm4hh masonry"><div class="xuqg4y9"><h5 class="h5 xxzf2ey">1998</h5><p class="xfxcabm">Founded, FCC 214 Licensed</p></div><div class="xd6smxn"><h5 class="h5 xxzf2ey">20+</h5><p class="xfxcabm">Global PoPs and IDCs</p></div><div class="xd6smxn"><h5 class="h5 xxzf2ey">3</h5><p class="xfxcabm">Core Business Lines</p></div><div class="xd6smxn"><h5 class="h5 xxzf2ey">24/7</h5><p class="xfxcabm">NOC Monitoring</p></div></div></div></div><div class="section-divider xbstc8l"><div class="x2h0iev"></div><div class="xqo6eaw"></div><div class="x2h0iev"></div></div><div class="carousel xctiiw2"><div class="h2 xwpnaea"><div class="xmyyotj"><h3 class="h3 x10uerp">Frequently Asked Questions</h3><p class="xq9pbwc">We are here to clear your doubts:</p></div></div><div class="xgjzcho"><div class="faq-accordian-item-2 xzkh4c6"><FaqItem question="Which destinations do you terminate?">Wholesale IDD termination covers global destinations, with particular strength across the Pacific: China, Hong Kong and Taiwan, plus India, Australia, the Middle East, Europe and the Americas. Send your target list and we will confirm coverage.</FaqItem></div><div class="faq-accordian-item-2 xzkh4c6"><FaqItem question="Are your routes direct or aggregated?">Direct. Termination runs on NNI relationships with hundreds of carriers, not aggregated resale.</FaqItem></div><div class="faq-accordian-item-2 xzkh4c6"><FaqItem question="How do you show route quality?">We share real ASR, ACD and latency for the routes you send, not just a rate card.</FaqItem></div><div class="faq-accordian-item-2 xzkh4c6"><FaqItem question="Do you route SMS as well?">Yes. Carrier-grade SMS routing runs alongside voice on the same interconnects.</FaqItem></div><div class="faq-accordian-item-2 xzkh4c6"><FaqItem question="How do I get started?">Send your target destinations and expected volume through the <a href="/contact-vocomai" class="text-link">contact page</a>, and the team will come back with routes and next steps.</FaqItem></div></div></div><div class="simple-footer-2 xzxrxrs footer-slot" data-pagefind-ignore><Footer footerTagline="Your partner for telecommunications and fiber optic supply." title="Quick Links" menu1="VOCOM AI" menu2="Services" menu3="RenOS AI Agents" link2="/vocom-services" link3="/vocom-ai-agents" /></div></div>
